---
import LegalPage from '../components/LegalPage.astro';
import { site, whatsappLink } from '../data/site';
---
<LegalPage title="Privacy Policy | OwnzoScale" h1="Privacy Policy" description="How OwnzoScale collects, uses and protects your information." updated="27 November 2026">
  <p>This policy explains what information OwnzoScale ("we", "us") collects when you use ownzoscale.com, why we collect it, and the choices you have. We keep it short and in plain English.</p>

  <h2>What we collect</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><b>Information you send us.</b> When you fill in our enquiry or call-request form, we receive what you type: your name, email, business name, website, the services you're interested in, budget, time preferences and your message.</li>
    <li><b>Messages on WhatsApp or email.</b> If you contact us directly, we receive your phone number or email address and what you write.</li>
    <li><b>Website usage (only if you accept cookies).</b> If you click "Accept" on our cookie banner, Google Analytics collects information such as the pages you visit, how you arrived, your device type and approximate location. If you click "Decline", analytics does not load.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>How we use it</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>To reply to your enquiry and arrange calls.</li>
    <li>To prepare quotes and deliver the work you hire us for.</li>
    <li>To understand how visitors use the site so we can improve it (analytics, with your consent).</li>
  </ul>
  <p>We do not sell your information, and we do not add you to a mailing list without asking.</p>

  <h2>Cookies</h2>
  <p>We use a small amount of browser storage to remember your cookie choice. Analytics cookies are only set if you accept them. You can change your choice at any time using "Cookie settings" in the footer.</p>

  <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
  <p>We keep enquiry details for as long as needed to respond and, if you become a client, for as long as needed to provide our services and keep proper business records. You can ask us to delete your details at any time.</p>

  <h2>Your choices and rights</h2>
  <p>You can ask us what information we hold about you, ask us to correct it, or ask us to delete it. Depending on where you live, you may have further rights under local law. Contact us using the details below and we'll respond as soon as we can.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Email: {site.email}<br />WhatsApp: <a href={whatsappLink} target="_blank" rel="noopener">+92 311 0020911</a></p>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>If we change this policy, we'll update the date at the top of this page.</p>
</LegalPage>
